{"version":1,"key":"quest:132","content":{"id":132,"title":"crossOrigin 属性的作用是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:132","type":"quest","id":132},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"跨域资源的不透明性与CORS属性","meta":"","excerpt":"在浏览器中，通过 script、img、video、audio 等标签引用跨域资源时，出于安全考虑，浏览器会将此资源视为不透明（Opaque），所谓的不透明通俗讲就是“只可远观而不可亵玩”，即脚本可以执行，图片可以显示，音视频可以播放，但是无法通过脚本获取到内容： 跨域脚本无法计算 integrity，无法验证资源完整","target":{"key":"card:674","type":"card","id":674},"citeKey":"card:674"}],"trail":[{"time":1768490847963,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1769093866892,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1769093866893,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1768490847963,"updateTime":1768490847963,"resolvedTime":1769093866893},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1768490847963}}